# alto 5-min meetup demo — Domain Storytelling guided discovery
# Requires: vhs, ttyd, ffmpeg, chrome
# Prereq: alto binary in PATH, docs/demo-guide-sim.sh exists
# Run: cd /home/kusanagi/Alty/alty-cli && vhs docs/alto-5min.tape
# Output: docs/alto-demo.gif

Output docs/alto-demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set Padding 20

Type "bash docs/demo-guide-sim.sh"
Enter
Sleep 46s
